{"id":"cbf2193c8d68c9be","group":"29","path":"29/29-lem-extension-probability.md","title":"扩张公理的概率界与几乎必然成立","display":"lem-extension-probability — 扩张公理的概率界与几乎必然成立","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-lem-extension-probability","aliases":["29-lem-extension-probability"],"display":"lem-extension-probability — 扩张公理的概率界与几乎必然成立","depends_on":["[[29-df-extension-axioms]]","[[29-df-asymptotic-prob]]"],"source_locator":"Lemma 6.38 and relational generalization, pp.107–108, DjVu scans 122–123","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-lem-extension-probability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-lem-extension-probability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-extension-probability — 扩张公理的概率界与几乎必然成立"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bcb53a9a5bd9405\" href=\"?note=8bcb53a9a5bd9405\" title=\"29-df-extension-axioms\">29-df-extension-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e0b02880da0dad2\" href=\"?note=7e0b02880da0dad2\" title=\"29-df-asymptotic-prob\">29-df-asymptotic-prob</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Lemma 6.38 and relational generalization, pp.107–108, DjVu scans 122–123"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,k,\\Gamma_{\\tau,k},\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}\">\\(\\tau,k,\\Gamma_{\\tau,k},\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bcb53a9a5bd9405\" href=\"?note=8bcb53a9a5bd9405\" title=\"29-df-extension-axioms\">29-df-extension-axioms</a> 的纯关系、正元数约定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq k\">\\(n\\geq k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_\\ell\\coloneqq|\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}|\">\\(m_\\ell\\coloneqq|\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{\\tau,n}\">\\(\\mu_{\\tau,n}\\)</span> 是所有论域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-结构上的均匀概率。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0\\leq1-\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\Gamma_{\\tau,k})\\leq\\sum_{0\\leq\\ell&lt;k}n^\\ell2^{m_\\ell}(1-2^{-m_\\ell})^{n-\\ell}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0\\leq1-\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\Gamma_{\\tau,k})\\leq\\sum_{0\\leq\\ell&lt;k}n^\\ell2^{m_\\ell}(1-2^{-m_\\ell})^{n-\\ell}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\Gamma_{\\tau,k})=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\Gamma_{\\tau,k})=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Lemma 6.38 及印刷页 108 的关系词汇推广。固定互异旧元素和一个模式时，每个新候选满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_\\ell\">\\(m_\\ell\\)</span> 个独立关系位，成功概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-m_\\ell}\">\\(2^{-m_\\ell}\\)</span>；不同新候选所涉及的关系元组互不重叠，因此全失败概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1-2^{-m_\\ell})^{n-\\ell}\">\\((1-2^{-m_\\ell})^{n-\\ell}\\)</span>。对至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^\\ell\">\\(n^\\ell\\)</span> 个旧元组及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{m_\\ell}\">\\(2^{m_\\ell}\\)</span> 个模式使用并集上界，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell&lt;k\">\\(\\ell&lt;k\\)</span> 求和。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,\\tau\">\\(k,\\tau\\)</span> 时每项指数衰减；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_\\ell=0\">\\(m_\\ell=0\\)</span> 的项在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq k\">\\(n\\geq k\\)</span> 时为零。已逐步核对这一本地推导。书中无向图证明把模式数写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>，一般应为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{k-1}\">\\(2^{k-1}\\)</span>；本条显式使用正确模式计数，不照抄该系数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-extension-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"8bcb53a9a5bd9405","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-extension-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-asymptotic-prob","status":"resolved","id":"7e0b02880da0dad2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-asymptotic-prob]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-extension-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"8bcb53a9a5bd9405","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau,k,\\Gamma_{\\tau,k},\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}$ 取 [[29-df-extension-axioms]] 的纯关系、正元数约定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau,k,\\Gamma_{\\tau,k},\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq k","display":false},{"tex":"m_\\ell\\coloneqq|\\Delta_{\\tau,\\ell}|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_{\\tau,n}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"0\\leq1-\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\Gamma_{\\tau,k})\\leq\\sum_{0\\leq\\ell<k}n^\\ell2^{m_\\ell}(1-2^{-m_\\ell})^{n-\\ell}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu_{\\tau,n}(\\Gamma_{\\tau,k})=1.","display":true},{"tex":"m_\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"2^{-m_\\ell}","display":false},{"tex":"(1-2^{-m_\\ell})^{n-\\ell}","display":false},{"tex":"n^\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"2^{m_\\ell}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell<k","display":false},{"tex":"k,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"m_\\ell=0","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"2^{k-1}","display":false}],"bytes":1723,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-extension-axioms]]、[[29-lem-extension-probability]]、[[29-lem-extension-pebble]] — 扩张公理、概率界和有限变量不可区分性"},{"id":"f2b15fc22e8e3f0c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-lem-extension-probability]]"},{"id":"bfe1be5f707cc63a","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-lem-extension-probability|29-lem-extension-probability]]"}],"outgoing":["8bcb53a9a5bd9405","7e0b02880da0dad2"]}